---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import EmailSignup from "../components/EmailSignup.astro";
---

<Base title="About" description="Who Pearl Davis is and what JustPearlyThings and The Audacity Network are about.">
  <span class="pill">The story</span>
  <h1>About Pearl</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Pearl Davis is the host of JustPearlyThings and founder of The Audacity Network.
    She reports on dating, family, and the family-court system on YouTube, podcasts,
    and in documentary work — focused on what men, fathers, and families actually
    experience inside those institutions.
  </p>

  <div class="grid cols-2">
    <div class="card center">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;">2M+</h3>
      <p class="muted">
        YouTube subscribers on
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@JustPearlyThings" rel="noopener">@JustPearlyThings</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="card center">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Since 2020</h3>
      <p class="muted">Producing independently across social, podcast, and long-form.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Why this site exists</h2>
  <p>
    A creator whose distribution belongs to someone else can be silenced by a policy
    change. That has happened to this channel repeatedly across TikTok, Instagram, and
    YouTube. This site is the version of the operation that isn't hosted on anyone else's
    platform — an address that can't be reassigned, a mailing list that can't be
    throttled, and a durable record of the reporting even when the underlying videos are
    removed elsewhere.
  </p>

  <h2>The mission</h2>
  <p>
    Cover what happens to men and families inside modern dating, marriage, and the
    family-court system — a beat mainstream outlets have underweighted for a generation.
    Publish sources next to claims. Keep the record durable even when the algorithm
    decides otherwise.
  </p>

  <h2>Press &amp; contact</h2>
  <p class="muted">
    For press, business, and support inquiries:
    <a href="mailto:production@theaudacitynetwork.com">production@theaudacitynetwork.com</a>
  </p>

  <EmailSignup compact />
</Base>
